		"Limit to users explicitly granted": "限制为明确获得",
		"read": "读取",
		"or higher access": "或更高权限的用户",
		"When enabled, only users explicitly granted access to this repository will be able to submit pull request reviews that \"approve\" or \"request changes\". All users able to submit comment pull request reviews will continue to be able to do so.": "启用后，只有明确获得此仓库访问权限的用户才能提交「批准」或「请求更改」的拉取请求审查。所有能够提交评论式拉取请求审查的用户仍可继续这样做。",
