		"Waiting for input from browser interaction...": "正在等待浏览器交互的输入…",
		"We could not verify your identity": "无法验证你的身份",
		"When you are ready, authenticate using the button below.": "准备就绪后，点击下方按钮进行身份验证。",
		"When you are ready, trigger a mailer to verify your identity.": "准备就绪后，点击下方按钮触发邮件以验证你的身份。",
