		"Configure": "配置",
		"We recommend configuring the runner under \"\\actions-runner\". This will help avoid issues related to service identity folder permissions and long path restrictions on Windows.": "建议将运行器配置在 \"\\actions-runner\" 下。这有助于避免与服务标识文件夹权限以及 Windows 长路径限制相关的问题。",
